:: Library 1 [Town] {"position":"3850,550","size":"100,100"}
You enter the big tree. Inside you can see a HUGE library with a bunch of NPCs and a few players reading some books. You can see a man next to the entarance. You assume thats the Librarian.

The inside of the tree is so big that more than 50 people could enter. There seems to be a second floor to the place so maybe around 80...
